  m_text: "Effective Date: Dec 20 2024\n\nAt Ryd Studios, we respect your privacy.
    This policy explains how your information is collected, used, and protected while
    playing Martian Frontier. By downloading and playing the game, you agree to the
    terms below.\n\n1. Information We Collect\n\nWe collect two types of information:\n\na.
    Personal Information\nWe do not collect personal information (e.g., name, email,
    phone number) unless you voluntarily provide it (e.g., for support requests).\n\nb.
    Non-Personal Information\nWe collect non-personal information, including:\n\n-
    Device information (e.g., operating system, device model).\n- Gameplay statistics
    (e.g., session length, in-game progress).\n- Advertising data (e.g., ad interactions).\n\nThis
    data is collected through third-party tools like Unity Analytics, Unity Ads and
    Google AdMob.\n\n2. How We Use Your Information\n\nThe information we collect
    is used for:\n\n- Improving game performance and user experience.\n- Showing
    relevant ads via Google AdMob.\n- Tracking gameplay trends with Unity Analytics
    to improve future updates.\n\nWe do not sell or share your data with unauthorized
    third parties.\n\n3. Third-Party Services\n\nMartian Frontier uses third-party
    tools that may collect and process your data:\n\na. Unity Analytics\nUsed to
    analyze game performance and user behavior. Learn more about Unity's privacy
    policy at unity.com/legal/privacy-policy.\n\nb. Unity Ads\nUsed to serve in-game
    ads. Learn more about Unity's privacy policy at unity.com/legal/privacy-policy.\n\nc.
    Google AdMob\nUsed to serve in-game ads. Learn more about Google\u2019s privacy
    policy on their website.\n\nThese services may collect additional data as per
    their privacy policies.\n\n4. User Accounts\n\nIf you create an account in Martian
    Frontier, we collect and store the information you provide (e.g., email address,
    username) to manage your account and provide access to game features. This data
    is not used for advertising purposes by Ryd Studios, but third-party services
    (e.g., Unity, Google) may collect data as outlined in their policies.\n\n5. Data
    Protection\n\nWe implement industry-standard security measures to protect your
    data. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot
    guarantee absolute security.\n\n6. International Users\n\nYour data may be transferred
    to, processed, and stored in countries outside of your residence. By using Martian
    Frontier, you consent to such transfers.\n\n7. Your Rights\n\nDepending on your
    region, you may have rights regarding your data, including the ability to access,
    update, or delete it. Contact us at team.rydstudios@gmail.com for requests.\n\n8.
    Changes to This Privacy Policy\n\nWe may update this policy from time to time.
    Changes will be effective immediately upon posting. Please review this policy
    periodically for updates.\n\n9. Contact Us\nIf you have any questions or concerns
    about this policy, please contact us at:\nEmail: team.rydstudios@gmail.com.\n\nBy
    playing Martian Frontier, you agree to this privacy policy."
